"about.story" = "This app was written by a dad for his 15-month-old daughter. She loves banging on the keyboard — at this age, banging is serious work: with the only means she has, she tests over and over that her actions make the world respond. So he wrote this: tap, and an animal pops up — “Look, a rabbit!” The app offers the fact that the world answers; the meaning comes from you. The child taps, you talk.";
